      "content": "i know you're trying to be nice but it doesn't feel untrue. it feels like facts. like, if i wasn't here, there would be less fighting, less crying, no more worrying about me. i can see it in their eyes sometimes. they're just so tired of dealing with my shit. it feels like the most selfless thing i could actually do is just stop being a problem for them.",
